# The macOS 12 build has no Media page in the Library (turned off by its user, 21 Nov 2026): the rail
# offers Downloads, Easels, Spaces, Boosts and Archived Tabs, and View Media… opens Downloads, so the
# Mac's picture folders are never read.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://action/viewMedia
expect-log library rail: downloads easels spaces boosts archive$
wait 1
cra://debug?themeShown=media
expect-log Cra theme shown media: .* library=downloads
